  "sourceIdentityQualifications": [
    "All17 source versions retain place=village, despite the civic profile using town/city language. Keep raw kind village.",
    "Coordinates moved during earlier mapping edits; the current point has remained exact since version13 on2020-07-11. This history does not certify a surveyed center or the legacy meteo anchor.",
    "Version7 in2012 incorrectly said is_in:governorate=Sfax; version8 in2013 changed it to Gabès, and the field was subsequently removed. The current cache and exact endpoint agree and contain no such governorate tag.",
    "The point and prayer base coordinates remain distinct. Same display identity does not merge their coordinates, create a city boundary or prove any imada equals the whole city."
  ],
